{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39277","headline":"题袁州谢秀才所居 · 韦庄","name":"题袁州谢秀才所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主人年少已能诗，更有松轩挂夕晖。\n芳草似袍连径合，白云如鸟傍檐飞。\n但将竹叶消春恨，莫遣杨花上客衣。\n若有前山好烟雨，与君吟到暝钟归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}